{"translation":{"id":"pan_irv","name":"ਇੰਡਿਅਨ ਰਿਵਾਇਜ਼ਡ ਵਰਜ਼ਨ (IRV) - ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=pan","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"IRV","englishName":"Punjabi Indian Revised Version Bible","language":"pan","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"7bcf70d369a169a12ac867ce44def25b36147b72029339f8c8d3c7a06bab588d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31104,"languageName":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","languageEnglishName":"Punjabi"},"book":{"id":"PSA","translationId":"pan_irv","name":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","commonName":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","title":"ਜ਼ਬੂਰ","order":19,"numberOfChapters":150,"sha256":"8a1b7c5c3025a80671b87659256d14a42fb58ace987b687a83db2b26ac8a5d95","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":150,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/150.json","totalNumberOfVerses":2461},"chapter":{"number":129,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["ਵੈਰੀਆਂ ਦੀ ਹਾਰ ਦੇ ਲਈ ਪ੍ਰਾਰਥਨਾ"]},{"type":"hebrew_subtitle","content":["ਯਾਤਰਾ ਦਾ ਗੀਤ"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ","poem":1},{"noteId":66},{"text":"ਨੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਮੇਰੀ ਜਵਾਨੀ ਤੋਂ ਬਹੁਤਾ ਦੁੱਖ ਦਿੱਤਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਇਸਰਾਏਲ ਇਹ ਆਖੇ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੇ ਮੈਨੂੰ ਮੇਰੀ ਜਵਾਨੀ ਤੋਂ ਬਹੁਤਾ ਦੁੱਖ ਦਿੱਤਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਪਰ ਉਹ ਮੇਰੇ ਉੱਤੇ ਪਰਬਲ ਨਾ ਹੋ ਸਕੇ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਹਾਲ੍ਹੀ ਨੇ ਮੇਰੀ ਪਿੱਠ ਉੱਤੇ ਹਲ ਵਾਹਿਆ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਨ੍ਹਾਂ ਨੇ ਲੰਮੇ-ਲੰਮੇ ਸਿਆੜ ਕੱਢੇ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਧਰਮੀ ਹੈ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਨੇ ਦੁਸ਼ਟਾਂ ਦੀ ਗੁਲਾਮੀ ਤੋਂ ਅਜ਼ਾਦ ਕੀਤਾ l","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿੰਨੇ ਸੀਯੋਨ ਨਾਲ ਵੈਰ ਰੱਖਦੇ ਹਨ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਸ਼ਰਮਿੰਦੇ ਹੋ ਕੇ ਪਛਾੜੇ ਜਾਣ!","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਉਹ ਛੱਤਾਂ ਦੇ ਘਾਹ ਵਰਗੇ ਹੋਣ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਹੜਾ ਵਧਣ ਤੋਂ ਪਹਿਲਾਂ ਹੀ ਸੁੱਕ ਜਾਂਦਾ ਹੈ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਜਿਸ ਦੇ ਨਾਲ ਵਾਢਾ ਆਪਣੀ ਮੁੱਠ ਨਹੀਂ ਭਰਦਾ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਨਾ ਪੂਲੇ ਬੰਨ੍ਹਣ ਵਾਲਾ ਆਪਣਾ ਪੱਲਾ,","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਤੇ ਲੰਘਣ ਵਾਲੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਆਖਦੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦੀ ਬਰਕਤ ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਉੱਤੇ ਹੋਵੇ,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"ਅਸੀਂ ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਯਹੋਵਾਹ ਦੇ ਨਾਮ ਤੋਂ ਬਰਕਤ ਦਿੰਦੇ ਹਾਂ।”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":66,"caller":"+","text":"ਮੇਰੇ ਵੈਰੀਆਂ","reference":{"chapter":129,"verse":1}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/129.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/130.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/pan_irv/PSA/128.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}